WEBVTT

00:03:25.704 --> 00:03:31.246
and A is only 78%
likely to lead to Z—

00:03:31.246 --> 00:03:33.579
far from an inevitability.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:38.204
If there’s a 95% likelihood of each step,

00:03:38.204 --> 00:03:44.579
the chance that A leads to Z 
plummets to about 28%.

00:03:44.579 --> 00:03:47.538
If there’s a 90% likelihood
at each step—

00:03:47.538 --> 00:03:50.871
still very likely by most standards—

00:03:50.871 --> 00:03:56.538
the chance that A leads to Z 
is only 7%.

00:03:56.746 --> 00:04:03.496
And if 24 of the 25 steps between A and Z 
are 99% likely,